Rejig: do not offer Astronomy's watch proxy or Continuity as App Library apps.
On iPhone 13 Pro Max / iOS 27.2, six reads after a 22-app addition showed every
regular app in the requested order, but dropped these two helpers, causing rollback.
They lack SBAppTags=hidden. Classify their exact bundle ids as non-placeable, keep
them in ignored, and refuse explicit imports instead of weakening readback checks.
Applies after the other patches to ios-homescreen at
97649547dbc44295e451c6bf130a87404481e10c. MIT; upstream copyright
(c) 2026 Yakup Emre Yerli (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

